[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 4147.669, "timestamp": "01:09:07", "text": "中国。比如，是谁给了他"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4150.149, "timestamp": "01:09:10", "text": "那玩意儿？他就像是说：“我不知道，伙计。”"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4153.189, "timestamp": "01:09:13", "text": "但文件核实无误。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4161.269, "timestamp": "01:09:21", "text": "那家企业真的会成功"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4163.51, "timestamp": "01:09:23", "text": "因为如果你观察太阳系，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4165.829, "timestamp": "01:09:25", "text": "星系里有那么多恒星，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4168.55, "timestamp": "01:09:28", "text": "现在这些行星。是的。就好像有"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4171.11, "timestamp": "01:09:31", "text": "行星的数量比我们拥有的沙粒数量还要多。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4177.91, "timestamp": "01:09:37", "text": "就像我一直喜欢的那样"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4180.309, "timestamp": "01:09:40", "text": "我对诸如“做什么”之类的事情很着迷"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4182.95, "timestamp": "01:09:42", "text": "外面有吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4184.43, "timestamp": "01:09:44", "text": "是否有"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4198.31, "timestamp": "01:09:58", "text": "那里？但我们是否也能拥有一个这样的星球呢？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4198.99, "timestamp": "01:09:58", "text": "只是"}]